<p>BECHAIN NAINAWA MEIN HAIN BETI RASOOL SAWW. KI.</p>

<p>SAR PEET-TI HAIN LAB PA HAI FARYAAD BAS YAHI.</p>

<p>GHAR LUT RAHA HAIN MERA MUSIBAT KI HAIN GHADI.</p>

<p>AB TO MADAD KE WAASTE AAJATI YA ALI ASWS.</p>

<p>
TANHA HAIN DUSHMANO'N MEIN NAWASA RASOOL SAWW. KA.</p>

<p>1. QASIM ASWS. KA LASHA GHODO'N SE PAAMAL HOGAYA.</p>

<p>TEER E SITAM SE CHID GAYA BESHEER KA GALA.</p>

<p>TOOTI KAMAR HUSSAIN ASWS. KI --ABBAS ASWS. MAR GAYA*2.</p>

<p>2. ZAINAB ASWS. NE APNE BACHON KO QURBAAN KARDIYA.</p>

<p>BARCHI JIGAR MEIN DHAS GAYI AKBAR ASWS. BHI CHAL BASA.</p>

<p>KHAATA HAI THOKAREIN'N MERI-- AAGOSH KA PALA..*2.</p>

<p>3. TALWAAR E NAUZE BARCHIYAA'N PATTHAR HAI HAR TARAF.</p>

<p>TANHA GHAREEB BEKAS O MAZLOOM HAI HADAF.</p>

<p>BINTE RASOOL SAWW. KARTI HAIN-- FARIYAAD YAA QUDA JJH..*2.</p>

<p>4. DASHTE BALA MEIN GOONJTE HAIN FATIMA S.A. KE BAIN.</p>

<p>LAASHE UTHAA KE THAK GAYA HAIN MERA NOOR E AIN.</p>

<p>AB ZERE TEGH HAI USI-- MAZLOOM KA GALAA..*2.</p>

<p>5. KUCH SOOJHTA NAHI MUJHE AAWAZ KISKO DU'N.</p>

<p>FARIYAAD MERI SUNTA NAHI KOI KYA KARU'N.</p>

<p>ALLAH JJH. ZIBHA HOTA HAIN-- ZEHRA S.A. KA LAADLA..*2.</p>

<p>6. NAAZO'N SE MAINE PAALA ISE CHAKKI PEESKAR.</p>

<p>KAISA YEH ZULM KARTE HAI US PAR YEH EHLE SHAR L.A.</p>

<p>PAAMAL UNKA LAASHA-- ZAMEE'N PAR PADAA HUAA..*2.</p>

<p>
7. ZEHRA S.A. KA NAUHA GOONJTA HAIN DASHT MEIN RASHEED.</p>

<p>AANSOO BAHAO HO GAYA IBNE ALI ASWS. SHAHEED.</p>

<p>MATAM KARO LABO'N PA-- RAHE WAA MUSEEBATA..*2.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RASHEED SHAHEEDI SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
</p>